      "translationZh": "返回新闻 2026年9月21日",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fbe89fca8508bb7",
      "translationZh": "SpaceXAI 最强大的编码和知识工作模型。速度是比较模型的两倍，价格仅为其一半。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54400b2f03480206",
      "translationZh": "免费试用 开始构建",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45a5868b3d72a2e8",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.7 是我们在编码和知识工作方面最强大的模型。它在困难任务上运行时间更长，更仔细地检查自己的工作，并配备了我们迄今为止最佳校准的防护措施。其价格和速度与 Grok 4.6 相同，在同类产品中具有很强的竞争力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35e6677dba09b2b5",
      "translationZh": "在 CursorBench 4.0（侧重于较长时间的编码任务）上，Grok 4.7 在价格性能方面处于领先地位。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "532e26b5985da405",
      "translationZh": "与 Grok 4.6 相比，Grok 4.7 使用了一个更新、更大的基础模型。它在更难的任务混合上进行了更长时间的强化学习训练，侧重于需要数小时才能完成的问题。模型在验证自身工作和管理更长上下文方面表现更佳。我们还训练 Grok 4.7 原生理解 Grok Bot harness，使其在对话任务和一般知识工作方面表现更好。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4134d6c323ce98c6",
      "translationZh": "每百万输入 token 的价格",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "345c1dc178028ee7",
      "translationZh": "每百万输出 token 的价格",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
