      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f071517bda8a5ff9",
      "translationZh": "多小时办公工作 AA Briefcase v1.1",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d13447324ee8b3d2",
      "translationZh": "多小时终端工作 Terminal-Bench 4.0",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c5b5b4465d44c5c",
      "translationZh": "法律工作 Harvey Legal Agent Benchmark",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a56222e5adab094b",
      "translationZh": "临床推理 HealthBench Professional",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a9ca3d28ce5501e",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.7、Grok 4.6、GPT-5.6 Sol 和 Fable 5.1 的 token 价格和基准分数。基准包括 CursorBench 4.0、DeepSWE v1.1、EEBench、AA Briefcase v1.1、Terminal-Bench 4.0、Harvey Legal Agent 基准和 HealthBench Professional。Grok 4.7 DeepSWE 上的星号表示高努力分数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b81e1b0c0afb5ebb",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.7 在创建文档和演示文稿方面表现更佳。在 GDPval 和 AA Briefcase 基准中，AI 被要求完成律师、护士和金融分析师等专业人士所做的任务。Grok 4.7 在两个基准上均优于 Grok 4.6，并且与其他前沿模型表现相当。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7fd983400bfa6201",
      "translationZh": "专业知识工作",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10fde84cbaa32ff1",
      "translationZh": "GDPval、AA Briefcase 和 EEBench 的分数对比了 Grok 4.7 与 Grok 4.6、Fable 5.1 以及 GPT-6 Astra。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dda7740519fca4d7",
      "translationZh": "安全与网络安全",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6e43e06e02f51b3",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.7 采用了全新的防护栈构建。在我们测试的模型中，它在拒绝和越狱抵抗方面表现最强。在网络安全和生物工作等双用途领域，它既在良性任务的实用性方面领先，又在危险任务的安全拒绝方面表现出色，在 LatchBio 的生物安全基准上达到 62.4%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "817f25f198d9a419",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.7 在强大的网络防御能力与合法使用时的低拒绝率之间取得平衡。在 HackerBench v0.3（我们用于评估风险和恶意网络任务的基准）上，它展示了最高的安全性，仅允许 3.3% 的高风险双用途提示通过，而很少阻断合法的安全工作。我们还开始向选定的网络安全合作伙伴提供仅限邀请的 Grok 4.7 红队能力访问权限，用于防御研究。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fbd02b3616f0593d",
      "translationZh": "定价与可用性",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d17db6c21010068",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.7 今日在 Cursor 和 Grok Build 中可用。它也可通过 Grok API、第三方编码工具链、模型路由器和云平台获得。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "840144b8ff7a2913",
      "translationZh": "该模型的起始价格为每百万输入 token 2 美元，每百万输出 token 6 美元。我们还提供一种输出速度是原来两倍的快速变体，价格也是原来的两倍。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "931d9292b9323e27",
      "translationZh": "在 Grok Build 中免费试用",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed7673105fd4f5a8",
      "translationZh": "今天即可在 x.ai/build 开始使用",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
